msgid "Scan each platform's skill directory, match sources using git ls-remote, confirm each entry, and generate SKILL.mod. An existing SKILL.mod is rejected unless --force rebuilds it after backing it up as SKILL.mod.bak."
msgstr "扫描各平台 skill 目录，经 git ls-remote 匹配来源，逐项确认后生成 SKILL.mod；已有 SKILL.mod 时拒绝执行，--force 可重建（备份为 SKILL.mod.bak）。"

