msgid "Versions must be semver tags or 40-character commit SHAs; branch names are rejected because they are mutable.\nWhen omitted, the version is resolved in this order: <subdirectory>/v<latest> → v<latest> → default-branch HEAD (recorded as a pseudo-version).\nWhen a subdirectory is omitted, get discovers SKILL.md at the repository root and recursively below skills/. It shows every candidate's name, description, and exact address, then accepts one or more selections. --yes installs every discovered skill."
msgstr "版本必须是 semver tag 或 40 位 commit SHA；分支名为可变引用，已拒绝。\n未指定版本时，按以下顺序解析：<子目录>/v<最新> → v<最新> → 默认分支 HEAD（记录为伪版本）。\n省略子目录时，get 会发现仓库根目录和 skills/ 下全部层级的 SKILL.md。它展示每个候选的名称、description 与精确地址，并支持选择一个或多个；--yes 会安装发现的全部 skill。"

msgid "With no names, update every entry. Commit-pinned entries, including pseudo-versions, advance to a new pseudo-version at default-branch HEAD."
msgstr "不带名称时作用于全部条目；commit 钉住的条目（含伪版本）升到默认分支 HEAD 的新伪版本。"

